WEBVTT

00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:31.292
It's lonely to shop online,

00:08:32.333 --> 00:08:34.292
and I miss hanging out with my friends.

00:08:34.875 --> 00:08:36.309
But on Pinduoduo,

00:08:36.333 --> 00:08:37.893
when I find a product,

00:08:37.917 --> 00:08:41.434
I can either buy it myself
at the regular price

00:08:41.458 --> 00:08:45.292
or I can share it with my friends
via social media,

00:08:46.292 --> 00:08:47.976
discuss it with them,

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.434
get their advice,

00:08:49.458 --> 00:08:51.851
and if we all choose to buy it together,

00:08:51.875 --> 00:08:53.125
we get a great deal.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:56.476
These deals last only for a short time,

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:57.958
just like in the real world.

00:08:58.667 --> 00:09:02.893
And there are lotteries
and games and flash sales